"Master of one-on-one combat, the speed of your spellcasting is matched only by your rapier.": "一对一对战的大师，你施法的速度只有你的细剑能与之匹敌。",
"Tier3, Master Of Duels, Master Of Swords, Class": "阶层3，决斗大师，剑术大师，职业",
"A combat specialist, melding sorcery with traditional martial techniques.": "一个战斗专家，将巫术与传统武艺技法融合。",
"Join the assembly that recognizes the good inherent in the light.": "加入认识到光明中固有之善的集会。",
"Steel and magic": "钢铁与魔法",
