"Tier4, Master Of Enchanting, Master Of Divination, Class": "阶层4，附魔大师，占卜大师，职业",
"'Do not take me for some conjurer of cheap tricks.'": "「别把我当成什么廉价把戏的骗子。」",
"Master of demons and demonic magic.": "恶魔与恶魔魔法的大师。",
"Tier4, Master Of Shadow, Master Of Demonology, Master Of Summoning, Class": "阶层4，暗影大师，恶魔学大师，召唤大师，职业",
"Tier4, Master Of The Arcane, Master Of Knowledge, Class": "阶层4，奥术大师，知识大师，职业",
"A master of death magic.": "死亡魔法的大师。",
"Burn away the taint on the world": "烧掉世界上的污点。",
"Sharp wit, sharper blade and some quick spells as backup, make for a formidable opponent.": " 锋利的机智，更锋利的利刃，加上一些快速法术作为后备，造就了一个强大的对手。",
"Tier4, Master Of Duels, Master Of Swords, Class": "阶层4，决斗大师，剑术大师，职业",
