"Tier4, Master Of Shadow, Master Of Necromancy, Master Of Minions, Class": "阶层4，暗影大师，死灵术大师，仆从大师，职业",
"Wielder of fire": "火焰操控者",
"An ancient magic from beyond the sea, combining spirit and blade.": "来自海外的古老魔法，结合了精神与利刃。",
"Contemplation of the small as well as great.": "对微小与伟大的沉思。",
"The light blesses you on your mission to create a virtuous world.": "光明祝福你创造美德世界的使命。",
"Tier4, Master Of Light, Master Of Healing, Class": "阶层4，光明大师，治愈大师，职业",
"Tier4, Master Of Swords, Class": "阶层4，剑术大师，职业",
"Tier4, Master Of Swords, Master Of Spirits, Class": "阶层4，剑术大师，灵魂大师，职业",
"You have taken your training further, weaving magic and steel with a flourish of magical grace.": "你的训练更进一步，将魔法与钢铁以魔法优雅绽放的方式编织在一起。",
"In the end it was three Thule Wizards and The Necromancer who brought the locks to heel.": "最终是三位图勒巫师和死灵法师让锁臣服。",
"Tier5, Master Of The Arcane, Master Of Knowledge, Class": "阶层5，奥术大师，知识大师，职业",
"Kell are not of mortal blood, and only potent magics can imbue a mortal with their essence.": "凯尔非凡胎之血，只有强力的魔法才能将它们的精华注入凡胎。",
"Tier5, Master Of Nature, Class": "阶层5，自然大师，职业",
"It waits in time.": "它在时间中等待。",
"Tier5, Master Of Divination, Class": "阶层5，占卜大师，职业",
"Disciple of death.": "死亡的门徒。",
"In the War of the Locks the Seven raged for Power Absolute, and Dhrune trembled in their wake.": "在锁之战中，七者为了绝对力量而狂暴，德鲁恩在他们身后颤抖。",
"Tier5, Master Of Shadow, Master Of Demonology, Master Of Summoning, Class": "阶层5，暗影大师，恶魔学大师，召唤大师，职业",
"Tier5, Master Of Shadow, Master Of Necromancy, Master Of Minions, Class": "阶层5，暗影大师，死灵术大师，仆从大师，职业",
"If you want a better future, make better people.": "如果你想要一个更好的未来，制造更好的人。",
"Master of magical constructs": "魔法构装体大师",
"Tier5, Master Of Crafting, Master Of Minions, Master Of Mechanics, Class": "阶层5，制作大师，仆从大师，机械大师，职业",
"Tier5, Master Of Swords, Class": "阶层5，剑术大师，职业",
"Your skills with blade and magic blend together in a blur, each stroke seeming like a step in a dance.": "你的利刃与魔法技能交融在一起，每一击都像是舞蹈中的一步。",
"After a mythic ascends, even the Archlocks curb their appetites.": "当一个神话存在飞升后，即使是远古锁也会克制他们的欲望。",
"Other members of the faith defer to your wisdom and experience": "信仰的其他成员听从你的智慧和经验。",
"Tier5, Master Of Light, Master Of Healing, Class": "阶层5，光明大师，治愈大师，职业",
"Tier6, Master Of Earth, Master Of Hammers, Class": "阶层6，地大师，锤大师，职业",
"Tier6, Master Of The Arcane, Master Of Knowledge, Class": "阶层6，奥术大师，知识大师，职业",
"When in good moods, Titans sculpted mountains. In bad ones, nations became craters.": "心情好时，泰坦雕刻山脉。心情不好时，国家变成巨坑。",
"Standing in the distant light of celestials, the mortal world seems so... Petty.": "站在超凡的 遥远光芒中，凡世显得如此……卑劣。",
"Tier6, Class": "阶层6，职业",
"'I am the flood and the tempest, the whisper-wind and the inferno'.": "「我是洪水与风暴，是低语之风与地狱火。」",
"An unholy synthesis of wizardry and demonology.": "巫术与恶魔学的邪恶合成。",
"Narz, Bodias, Vezial. Even among the Archlocks, some names stood in abject terror.": "纳尔兹、博迪亚斯、维齐亚尔。即使在远古锁之中，有些名字也令人极端恐惧。",
"Tier6, Master Of Elements, Class": "阶层6，元素大师，职业",
