 // --- 描述/说明文本 ---
 "Cleave the air to harm multiple foes.": "撕裂空气以伤害多个敌人。",
 "Leave your enemies something to remember your sword by.": "给敌人留下对你剑术的深刻印象。",
 "Spinning is a good trick": "旋转是个好把戏",
 "Sword, Nature": "剑，自然",
 "Reflect the sun off your blade to blind your foes.": "用剑刃反射太阳光致盲敌人。",
 "A brutish move, for a less civilized mage.": "粗野的招式，适合不那么文明的法师。",
 "A downward slash, inaccurate, but devastating.": "下劈斩，不精准但毁灭性十足。",
 "a rapier.": "一把细剑。",
 "Aim for the tendons and joints to weaken your enemy's attacks.": "瞄准肌腱和关节以削弱敌人的攻击。",
 "Cut them off at the kneecaps, or the elbows, or whatever they happen to have.": "砍掉膝盖骨、手肘或他们恰好有的任何部位。",
 "Cut down a group of foes with the power of the ocean.": "以海洋之力横扫一群敌人。",
 "blood to empower a strike.": "以血赋能一击。",
 "A graceful cut, shredding through enemies.": "优雅的一斩，撕裂敌人。",
 "A revolution in your wrist.": "手腕的旋转。",
 "Sap an enemy's life force through your blade.": "通过剑刃汲取敌人的生命力。",
 "Shadow, Spell": "暗影，法术",
 "A sharp blade goes through like butter.": "锋利的剑刃切下去如切黄油。",
 "strength to deal a forceful strike.": "以力量施以强力一击。",
 "A refined move, for a more civilized mage.": "优雅的招式，适合更文明的法师。",
 "An involved technique that briefly bypasses an opponent's defenses.": "一种复杂的技巧，短暂绕过对手的防御。",
 "Holes in armor are sometimes a really good idea.": "盔甲上开洞有时确实是个好主意。",
 "Leave a hole in your foe's armor.": "在敌人的盔甲上开个洞。",
 "A basic move, yet incredibly effective.": "基本的动作，却极其有效。",
 "A direct strike at the opponent.": "对敌人的直接打击。",
 "A pinnacle of rapier techniques.": "细剑技术的巅峰。",
 "A strike to the heart. Must be performed on an engaged enemy.": "直击心脏。必须在接敌状态下执行。",
 "Not just a gentle poke.": "不仅仅是轻轻一戳。",
 "Put some power behind your thrusts.": "为你的突刺注入力量。",
 "A thunderous blow that does impressive damage.": "雷霆一击，造成可观伤害。",
 "That's gonna leave a bruise in the morning.": "明天早上肯定会淤青。",
 "A swing designed to crush armor and whatever's behind it.": "旨在粉碎盔甲及其背后一切的一击。",
 "Keeping the local armorsmith in business.": "让当地铁匠生意兴隆。",
 "En garde!": "准备！",
 "Engage the enemy in close quarters, sacrificing defense for offense.": "与敌人近距离交战，以防御换取攻击。",
 "Take a break from the time stream.": "从时间流中休息片刻。",
 "Kanna's dance was a strenuous one for a mage, and a deadly one to her enemies.": "坎娜之舞对法师来说是剧烈的，对敌人则是致命的。",
 "All who dare attack you will be stained crimson": "所有胆敢攻击你的人都将被染成深红",
 "Must be using a rapier": "必须使用细剑",
 "Utilize your rapier mastery to counter all comers.": "运用你的细剑精通反击所有来敌。",
 "Adios!": "再见！",
 "Jump away from the enemy, restoring your defensive capabilities": "跳离敌人，恢复防御能力",
 "Effect scales with your maximum barrier, restoring about half of it.": "效果随你的最大屏障值提升，恢复约一半。",
 "Restore your barrier with a surge of arcane energy": "用一阵奥术能量恢复屏障",
 "The full weight of a wizard's gaze is often overpowering.": "法师凝视的全部重量常常令人难以承受。",
