"A large spire which rose from the ground. It looks like it might collapse any day now.": "一座拔地而起的高耸尖塔，如今摇摇欲坠，仿佛随时都会倾颓。",
"A vibrant meadow where hawthorn trees bloom and mayflowers carpet the ground. On Beltane, the old pacts loosen here first, and fae lights dance among the flowers.": "一片生机盎然的草甸，山楂树繁花盛放，五月花铺满地际。每逢贝尔坦节，古老契约最先在此松动，仙灵萤火在花间翩跹起舞。",
"An ancient crypt of crumbling stone.": "一座石体崩坏的古老陵窟。",
"An ancient library at the bridge spanning Markhul's gap.": "横跨马尔库尔裂隙的石桥之上，矗立着一座古老藏书馆。",
"At the bottom of the bottomless, lies an entrance to a plane darker than ink.": "无底深渊之底，藏着一处比墨色更为幽暗的位面入口。",
"Beneath the tallest idrasil a great menagerie thrives beneath a second sky.": "至高世界树的荫蔽之下，一方异兽秘境在第二层天穹下繁衍生息。",
"Fae lights dance among the flowers, guiding those who honor the old ways.": "仙灵萤火花间流转，引守古道、心怀敬意之人前行。",
"Its creator and purpose are unknown to history. Perhaps all creatures exist within.": "它的创造者与建造初衷早已湮没于历史尘埃，或许万物生灵皆存于其内里之中。",
"Old Mirthemgnar dug its dungeons til they joined the hollows beneath the world. In terror they sealed them forever. Or so they tried.": "古老的米尔瑟姆纳部族深挖地牢，直至连通地底空洞。满怀恐惧的他们将其永久封印——至少他们曾试图如此。",
"One of the most perilous mountains in the world. Many journey over its passes; none venture within.": "世间最凶险的山脉之一。无数人穿行其隘口，却无人敢深入腹地。",
"Only a small trading post marks the boundary of the lost cities of Orrem. Weathered masonry jutting from the sands beyond bespeak monuments of unimaginable proportions.": "仅有一处小型贸易驿站，标示着奥雷姆失落古城的边界。风沙之外，风化石垣突兀林立，昭示着曾有难以想象的宏伟古迹屹立于此。",
"Site Of Learning, Locale": "学识圣地 · 地域场景",
"Some things are left to time.": "有些事物，只可交由时光沉淀。",
"Tenwick's trail runs a circuit about the notable areas of Dhrune. On foot it takes the better part of a year to complete.": "滕威克小径环绕德伦大陆各处名胜蜿蜒曲折，徒步走完全程，几乎要耗费整整一年光阴。",
"The deeper woods posses many features of interest to the magical scholar. The spirits of the place make sure to keep the troublemakers out.": "密林深处藏有诸多令法师学者心驰神往的奇景，此地的灵体自会将滋事之徒隔绝在外。",
"The half-goblin Pidwig has sailed the waters around his bay for hundreds of years. In that time he has collected a myriad of interesting artifacts.": "半地精皮德维格，已在自家海湾航行了数百年之久。漫长岁月里，他收藏了数不胜数的奇珍古物。",
"The knowledge within may be beyond price.": "其中蕴藏的学识，价值无可估量。",
"The large grounds before the locked away estate once owned by Corivar.": "科里瓦尔昔日隐秘宅邸前，一片广阔空旷的庭园。",
"The lost Hall of Ages was a gathering place of great and powerful patron mages.": "失落的岁月圣殿，曾是一众强大守护法师的聚首之地。",
"The nearby village's fields are vast and full of opportunity for an有抱负的mage.": "邻近村落的田野广袤无垠，对有志修行的法师而言，处处皆是机缘。",
"The small and tranquil island is inhabited by an old hermit named Thyffr.": "这座宁静的小小岛屿，隐居着一位名为赛弗的隐士老者。",
"Third of the Four Weirs of Dhrune.": "德伦四大堰坝之第三堰。",
"This tiny outpost in the center of Thangmor outlasted even the pillars.": "桑摩尔腹地的这座小型前哨，存续岁月甚至胜过古老石柱。",
"Tradition tells of a spring with enchanted waters. Investigations might prove revealing.": "传说此地有一处灵泉，泉水蕴有魔力，深入探寻或许会有惊人发现。",
"Underwater, Dungeon": "水下 · 地牢场景",
"Veldran never did manage to carve a kingdom from the wreck of Bodias' reign. But he did accrue a sizeable hoard.": "维尔德兰始终未能从波迪亚斯王朝的废墟中开辟出属于自己的王国，却积攒下了一笔数额庞大的宝藏珍藏。",
"Would the ancient seredites appreciate the temple's new inhabitants?": "远古的赛瑞德族人，会接纳这座神殿的新住民吗？",
"You could spend a century in Fazbit's lost workshop and not exhaust its creations.": "纵使在法兹比特的失落工坊流连百年，也无法穷尽其中的造物奇珍。",
