"Sort through gathered mayflowers, trimming stems and separating the best blooms. The offcuts take root surprisingly fast in Beltane soil.": "整理采集到的五月花，修剪花茎，挑出最好的花朵。剪下的部分在贝尔坦土壤中生根速度快得惊人。",
"Yields prepared mayflowers and a few herbs from the trimmings": "产出处理好的五月花以及修剪下来的少量草药。",
"You toss the clippings aside and they're already sprouting by the time you look back.": "你把剪下的枝叶扔到一边，回头再看时它们已经发芽了。",
"Perform the ancient Beltane fertility ritual, calling upon the Old Growth to bless the land with abundant growth.": "执行古老的贝尔坦丰饶仪式，呼唤古林祝福大地，使其丰饶生长。",
"The Old Growth's presence fills the grove with life.": "古林的存在让树林充满生机。",
