"Significantly increases the benefits of resting at the cost of gold": "以消耗金币为代价显著提升休息收益。",
"Staffed with the most experienced professionals in the field of leisure, one could spend days here without even noticing.": "由休闲领域最有经验的专业人士人员，你可以在不知不觉中在这里待上数天。",
