"Earthsource, Furniture": "地之源，家具",
"Rocks and sand form patterns of intricate design.": "岩石和沙子形成复杂设计的图案。",
"A niche dedicated to scrolls.": "专门放置卷轴的壁龛。",
"Constantly sells your scroll supply at your behest.": "按照你的指令持续出售你的卷轴供应。",
"Inspiration struck and you devised a more elaborate loom, enchanted to weave ink and paper instead of thread.": "灵光一现，你设计了一个更精致的织机，附魔以编织墨水和纸张而非线。",
"A shrine to divine forces.": "神圣力量的神龛。",
"Lightsource, Good Acts, Furniture": "光明源，善良行为，家具",
"This was a triumph. I'm making a note here, 'Huge Success.'": "这是一次胜利。我在此备注：『巨大成功』。",
"Weavesource, Furniture": "编织源，家具",
"Motes of stars fall daily from the sky. One need only collect them.": "星尘每日从天而降。只需收集它们。",
"Pools of light congeal softly in the basin.": "光之池在水池中柔和凝结。",
"Airsource, Lightsource, Furniture": "气之源，光明源，家具",
"Intricate patterns of light and a gentle breeze flow through its elaborate designs.": "复杂的光影图案和轻柔微风在其精致设计中流动。",
