"Grows bodies from raw materials.": "从原材料中培植身体。",
"The most intricate one yet. Shuttles clack as it binds codices into tomes.": "到目前为止最复杂的一个。梭子咔嗒作响，将典籍装订成典籍。",
"Cut open 'willing' participants to see what makes your undead tick. A tendon here, a ligament there.": "切开「愿意」的参与者，看看你的亡灵是怎么运作的。这里一根肌腱，那里一条韧带。",
"Earthsource, Pets, Naturesource, Furniture": "地之源，宠物，自然源，家具",
