"Rest in pieces.": "碎碎平安。",
"Captures your vital essence and condenses it into a gem.": "捕获你的生命精华并将其凝结成宝石。",
"Holds equipment you aren't using.": "存放你未使用的装备。",
"A space suitable for crafting and enchanting items.": "适合制作和附魔物品的空间。",
"Workspace, Book Furniture, Furniture": "工作空间，书家具，家具",
"A vast mound of earth dedicated to occult practices.": "用于神秘实践的庞大 土丘。",
"Starsource, Ritesource, Furniture": "星之源，仪式源，家具",
"Travel the underground waterways looking for lost treasure,隐藏的 stashes or to clean up some troubling monsters.": "穿越地下水道，寻找遗失的宝藏、隐藏藏匿点，或清理一些麻烦的怪物。",
"You'll need to hold your breath while inside this dungeon.": "在这个地下城中你需要屏住呼吸。",
"Finally, someplace pleasant in this wretched city.": "终于，在这个破败的城市中找到了一个宜人之地。",
"An ancient grove where the Beltane fires have burned every spring since before anyone kept count. Here stands the maypole, and here the Old Growth walks.": "一片古老的树林，早在有人计数之前，贝尔坦之火每年春天都在此燃烧。五月柱矗立于此，古林在此行走。",
"The maypole's ribbons never stop moving, even when there's no wind.": "五月柱的丝带永不停歇地飘动，即使在没有风的时候。",
"Where the ancient pacts hold weakest, the kell gather to test anyone bold enough to enter. Shared blood counts for nothing here — a few years among them is beneath their notice. Survive the trials and the Old Growth itself will judge you worthy.": "在古老契约最薄弱之处，凯尔聚集以考验任何敢于进入的人。共同血液在此毫无意义——在它们中间待上几年都不值得它们注意。通过试炼，古林本身将判断你是否值得。",
"A good apprentice spends all their free time in the library. After chores, of course.": "一个好学徒把所有空闲时间都花在图书馆里。当然，是在做完杂务之后。",
"Loose Cog: 5% ": "松动齿轮：{{0}}% ",
