"Did you hear something?": "你听到了什么吗？",
"Healing Spell": "治疗法术",
"Seams of light close your wounds.": "光痕缝合你的伤口。",
"Reknit the body and recall the soul of a stronger humanoid or goblinoid minion.": "重织躯体并召回更强人形或哥布林形仆从的灵魂。",
"Braveaura": "勇气光环",
"Minions (♾️)": "仆从（♾️）",
