"Regen Buff": "再生增益",
"Unlocks the Paladin entry in your bestiary after first cast. ": "首次施放后解锁怪物图鉴中的「圣骑士」条目。",
"All your studies fall neatly into place.": "你所有的研究都各归其位。",
"I know the pieces fit.": "我知道碎片吻合。",
