 "Reflect the sun off your blade to blind your foes.": "用剑刃反射太阳光致盲敌人。",
 "A brutish move, for a less civilized mage.": "粗野的招式，适合不那么文明的法师。",
 "A downward slash, inaccurate, but devastating.": "下劈斩，不精准但毁灭性十足。",
