"A bit too quiet for your liking": "安静得有点过头",
"A strong gust of wind nearly knocks you over": "一阵强风差点把你吹倒",
"A flock of birds takes flight in the distance": "一群鸟在远处起飞",
"A cold mist clings to the ground": "一层冷雾贴近地面",
"A narrow path winds through the dense undergrowth": "一条狭窄的小路蜿蜒穿过茂密的灌木丛",
"A putrid stench fills the air": "空气中弥漫着腐臭的味道",
"A shallow grave has been disturbed": "一个浅坟被扰动了",
"A broken cart lies abandoned on the roadside": "一辆破碎的马车被遗弃在路边",
"A circle of standing stones hums with latent power": "一圈竖立的石头嗡嗡作响充满潜在力量",
"A clearing in the woods reveals a small cottage": "林中的一片空地露出一个小屋",
"Your path is blocked by a fallen tree": "你的路被一棵倒下的树挡住",
"A small stream cuts across the path": "一条小溪横穿小路",
"The ground here is scorched and barren": "这里的土地烧焦而贫瘠",
"An eerie silence fills the air": "一种诡异的寂静弥漫在空气中",
"Old bones litter the floor of the cave": "洞穴地面上散落着古老的骨头",
"A faint whispering can be heard on the wind": "风中可以听到微弱的低语声",
"A single footprint is pressed into the mud": "泥中印着一个单独的脚印",
"Charred remains of a campfire smolder": "篝火的烧焦残余物还在闷燃",
"A foul miasma rises from the swamp": "一股恶臭的瘴气从沼泽中升起",
"The ground trembles beneath your feet": "你脚下的地面在颤抖",
"You can purchase this once per completion of Musty Library": "每次完成霉味图书馆可以购买一次",
"A Dimensional Probe has already been prepared": "一个维度探测仪已经准备好了",
"Dimensional Probe requires additional elemental energies": "维度探测仪需要额外的元素能量",
"A mount that doesnt require much training": "一个不需要太多训练的坐骑",
"This horse has seen better days": "这匹马风光不再",
"A calm and sturdy horse, for moderate journeys": "一匹 沉稳而结实的马，适合 中程旅行",
"A fine horse in its prime": "一匹正当壮年的好马",
"Hooves of flame leave lines of fire in the ground": "火焰蹄在地上留下火线",
"Fly on the winds": "在风中飞行",
"A winged horse": "一匹有翅膀的马",
"As fleet as it is fearsome": "既迅捷又骇人",
"A small but helpful charm": "一个小而有用的护符",
"Continue working even while idle": "即使闲置时也继续工作",
"Learn the secret languages of birds": "学习鸟类的秘密语言",
"Keep your money safe": "安全保管你的钱",
