"Bag for holding herbs": "用于存放草药的袋子",
"Pouch for holding runes": "用于存放符文的袋子",
"Stores magical energy": "储存魔法能量",
"The quill lifts off the desk and begins to write": "羽毛笔从书桌上抬起开始书写",
"An invisible spirit binds your scrolls into codices": "一个无形的幽灵将你的卷轴装订成法典",
"Hold more spirits in your sway": "在你的掌控中控制更多灵魂",
"Finely carved wooden pipe": "精雕细刻的木烟斗",
"Focus of temporal synchronicity": "时间同步性的焦点",
"A globe of the stars and constellations": "星辰和星座的球体",
"A small mechanical model of the known worlds": "已知世界的小型机械模型",
"A comprehensive catalog of Dhrune greatest history": "德鲁恩最伟大历史的 综合目录",
"A comprehensive work on Dhrune history": "关于德鲁恩历史的 综合著作",
"A simple deck of cards": "一副简单的卡牌",
"You create your own luck": "你创造自己的运气",
"Youll make your own bags, thank you": "你会自己做袋子的谢谢你",
"Cheaper than buying pouches": "比买袋子便宜",
"Allows for expedient getaways": "允许快速逃离",
