"Unlocks abilities to scribe scrolls and bind codices as continuous actions": "解锁将抄写卷轴和装订法典作为连续行动的能力",
"Improve the speed of your gem enchanting": "提高你的宝石附魔速度",
"Improve the speed of your book writing": "提高你的书籍写作速度",
