"🛠️You Need That To Live!": "🛠️你需要那个才能活！",
"🛠️🔥Blazing Heat & Consuming Flames": "🛠️🔥炽热与吞噬烈焰",
"🛠️🔥Soul Embers & Pure Embers": "🛠️🔥灵魂余烬与纯净余烬",
"Game Mechanic, Pyromancy, Glossary Entry": "游戏机制，火焰占卜，词条",
"➢ Soul embers are the fuel for your Pyromancer's flames. They increase your Blazing Heat production at the expense of worsening Consuming Flames.\n\n➢ You can obtain Soul embers by performing the 'Ignite Ember' task once you have purchased the 'Soulflames' skill.\n\n➢ Balancing Soul embers with your spelllist to achieve thermal equilibrium is paramount to ensuring your wizard's survival in combat.\n\n➢ A combination of the 'Inflame' and 'Soul Blaze' spells can tune your Soul ember to a generally sustainable range, by reducing if too hot or increasing if too cold.\n\n➢ Pure embers are a resource used to purchase various upgrades for your Pyromancer. They can be produced by using your Blazing Heat as cost for the 'Produce Pure Embers' task.\nThe amount of Pure embers generated will equal your Soul ember count.": "➢ 灵魂余烬是火焰术士之焰的燃料。它们会提升炽热产量，代价是加剧吞噬烈焰。\n\n➢ 购买「灵魂烈焰」技能后，可通过执行「点燃余烬」任务获得灵魂余烬。\n\n➢ 平衡灵魂余烬与法术列表以达到热平衡，是确保巫师在战斗中生存的关键。\n\n➢ 结合「燃焰」与「灵魂烈焰」法术，可将灵魂余烬调节至可持续范围——过高则降低，过低则升高。\n\n➢ 纯净余烬是一种用于为火焰术士购买各种升级的资源。以炽热为消耗执行「生产纯净余烬」任务即可产出纯净余烬。\n产生的纯净余烬数量等于灵魂余烬数量。",
"➢ Upon casting fire spells, igniting enough soul embers or utilizing specialized techniques, your Pyromancer will begin to accumulate 'Blazing heat'.\n\n➢ This empowers most fire spells and increases your Fire mana rate. However, there is a limit to how much Blazing Heat your wizard can sustain.\n\n➢ The downside to accruing large amounts of Blazing Heat, is a negative Menace called Consuming Flames.\n\n➢ Consuming Flames have no immediate effect on your wizard's well-being, however letting them accumulate to your maximum will cause a forced retreat and a loss of any ongoing exploration or combat.\nTherefore, ensuring that your flames are controlled is of paramount priority.\n\n➢ There are several equilibrium upgrades which help in maintaining this delicate balance. You can also use the 'Disperse Heat' and 'Fan the Flames' actions to quickly manipulate it.\n\n➢ Some general tips to manage heat are as follows:\n• Memorize the vent spells of different elements your Pyromancer will unlock. These include Scalding Steam, Molten Earth and Searing Wind. Adding enough of these will eventually counterbalance your fire spells' heat.\n• Switching to the 'Cooling Immersion' Leisure in the Player Tab.\n• Purchasing the Heat Capacitor and Heat Conductor furnitures.": "➢ 施放火焰法术、点燃足够多的灵魂余烬或使用特殊技巧时，火焰术士将开始积累「炽热」。\n\n➢ 炽热会强化大部分火焰法术并提升火法力速率。但巫师能承受的炽热是有限度的。\n\n➢ 积累大量炽热的副作用是名为「吞噬烈焰」的负面威胁。\n\n➢ 吞噬烈焰不会立即影响巫师的健康，但若让其积累至最大值，将导致强制撤退并失去所有正在进行的探索或战斗。\n因此，控制烈焰是重中之重。\n\n➢ 有若干平衡升级可帮助维持这一精妙平衡。你也可以使用「散热」和「煽风」动作快速调节。\n\n➢ 一些管理热量的小贴士：\n• 记忆火焰术士将解锁的不同元素排气法术，包括灼热蒸汽、熔岩大地和灼热之风。加入足够的此类法术最终将平衡火焰法术的热量。\n• 在玩家选项卡中切换至「冷却沉浸」休闲活动。\n• 购买热力电容和热力导体家具。",

