"The final step on the twisting stairwell of apprenticeship.": "学徒生涯旋转楼梯的最后一步。",
"Enter into the practice of witchcraft.": "进入巫术的实践。",
"Extend your life with spare parts from the dead.": "用死者的备用零件延长你的生命。",
"Rate: {{0}}":"获取率：{{0}}",
"A spiral of致命icicles.": "一道致命的冰锥螺旋。",
"Hulking mass, constantly shifting and dripping. Slow, but immense.": "庞大的体块，不断变换和滴落。缓慢但巨大。",
"Bottled tar, perfect for making someone flammable.": "瓶装焦油，非常适合让人变得易燃。",
"A pocket of the endless sea.": "无尽之海的一个空间。",
"An island floating in an endless sky.": "漂浮在无尽天空中的一座岛屿。",
"Youve learned better. Perfected the science. You can recreate yourself perfect and free of mankinds flaws.": "你已经学得更好。完善了这门科学。你可以重新创造自己，完美且摆脱人类的缺陷。",
"Luxurious bedding, perfect air temperature.": "豪华床品，完美的空气温度。",
"Its faint light stirs the restless spirits.": "它微弱的光芒搅动不安的灵体。",
"A crystal sphere revealing遥远lands.": "揭示远方土地的水晶球。",
"A bolt of fire with lingering flames": "带有残留火焰的火焰箭。",
