"Human skull.": "人类头骨。",
"Imprisoned souls of living creatures.": "被囚禁的生灵灵魂。",
"Is it wrong?": "这样做不对吗？",
"Take care, lest it turns into a wildfire.": "小心，以免酿成野火。",
"The rising flames in your soul.": "你灵魂中升腾的火焰。",
" Conversion per Debt": " 债务转化率",
"Debt is gnawing at you": "债务正在啃噬着你。",
"Hold on, the stables were demolished a century ago?": "等等，马厩一个世纪前就被拆了？",
"No relation to usage of postmen to deliver volatile materials.": "与使用邮递员运送不稳定材料无关。",
"Sacred flowers from the hawthorn tree, gathered on Beltane morning. They carry the essence of protection and fertility magic.": "贝尔坦清晨采集的山楂树圣花。蕴含着保护与丰饶魔法的精华。",
"The fae are said to guard hawthorn trees, and their blossoms are most potent when gathered at dawn on Spring's first day.": "据说精灵守护着山楂树，其花在春分黎明时采集功效最强。",
"A token blessed by the Beltane fires and the Old Growth's touch, granting growth and abundance.":
"受贝尔坦之火与远古生长祝福的令牌，赐予生长与丰饶。",
"Carved from hawthorn wood and blessed in the Beltane flames.": "以山楂木雕刻并在贝尔坦火焰中祝福。",
"Flowers blessed by the Beltane fires, vibrant with seasonal magic.": "受贝尔坦之火祝福的花朵，充盈着季节的魔力。",
"Wearing a mayflower crown grants protection from the fae's mischief.": "佩戴五月花冠可免受精灵恶作剧的侵扰。",
" Constant conversion for Dimensional Probe Materials": " 维度探测材料持续转化",
 "Constant conversion for Dimensional Probe Materials": "维度探测材料持续转化",
"A skilled user could put on a marvellous show.": "熟练者可以献上一场精彩的表演。",
"B33P B00P.": "哔33噗 哔00噗。",
"Constructs of translucent crystal; they possess a pristine intellect for learning.": "半透明水晶构装体，拥有纯净的学习智慧。",
"Easily controlled, yet fundamentally inert.": "易于控制，但本质上惰性。",
"In your wildest...": "在你最疯狂的……",
"It's not smarter than you, surely.": "肯定没你聪明。",
"Towering hulks of metal, ready to do their master's bidding.": "高耸的金属巨兽，随时听候主人的命令。",
"How many of you have one?": "你们有多少人有一个？",
"Imbued with time energies, this timepiece shows the current time no matter when you are.":
"注入了时间能量，无论你身在何时，这只钟表都能显示当前时间。",
"The pillars broke; the stars fell screaming from the sky.": "支柱断裂，星辰尖叫着从天际坠落。",
"You can do anything!": "你无所不能！",
"Crystallized soulflame, tempered with annihilating energies.": "结晶化的灵魂烈焰，以湮灭能量淬炼。",
"Too precious to ever entrust to anyone.": "太过珍贵，绝不能托付给任何人。",
"Bodies for necromantic magic.": "用于死灵魔法的尸体。",
"Human bones.": "人类骨头。",
"The dust of human bones.": "人类骨头的粉末。",
"An ordinary timepiece, crafted with remarkable materials.": "以非凡材料打造的普通钟表。",
"Nothing occurs within this room.": "这个房间里空无一物。",
"Perfect for高度专业化 experiments.": "非常适合高度专业化的实验。",
"The time is L1:69.": "时间是L1:69。",
"Chaos, chaos!": "混沌，混沌！",
"The force from the beginning.": "始于太初的力量。",
"The secret courtesy that courses like ichor.": "如同灵液般流淌的秘密礼仪。",
"There was a GEM here. It's gone now.": "这里曾有一颗宝石。现在已经不在了。",
"The handwriting of an uneducated ragamuffin like you is no good for penning magic texts. Master ordered writing supplies for you to practice every stroke.": "像你这种未受教育的衣衫褴褛者的笔迹 不适合撰写魔法文本。师傅订购了书写用品让你练习每一笔。",
"When first asked to write your name, you produced a script not yet known to man.":
"第一次被要求写名字时，你写出了一种人类未知的文字。",
"A wooden box brimming with tools for gathering and preserving herbs, flowers, and roots.":
"一个装满用于采集和保存草药、花卉和根茎工具的木质盒子。",
"Allows for a gentle breeze to fill your cramped room.": "让一缕轻柔的微风 充满你狭窄的房间。",
"From where does the zephyr come?": "这阵和风从何处来？",
"Improving your tools": "改进你的工具。",
"With enough research you can find money lenders which don't have such ridiculous interest rates":
"只要研究足够，你可以找到利息不那么离谱的放贷人。",
"📖Musty Library": "📖霉味图书馆",
"Every province has its handful of runaway apprentices and failed Adepts. It's not uncommon for thieves and rangers to know a spell or two. They are nothing compared to the talents of a true professional.":
"每个省份都有一些逃跑的学徒和失败的熟练者。盗贼和游侠会一两个法术并不罕见。但与真正的专业人士相比，他们不值一提。",
"The circle's ward shields you from harm.": "魔法阵的结界保护你免受伤害。",
"Eavesdrop upon the breeze to gather gossip and blackmail.": "在微风中窃听以收集八卦和勒索。",
"I've had worse.": " 更糟的我都经历过。",
"Closer. Closer. Somewhere they'll never leave your sight.": "靠近些。再靠近些。在某个他们永远不会离开你视线的地方。",
"Compendium of common creatures.": "常见生物的汇编。",
"'What do you see in the abyss?' 'Perfection.'": "'你在深渊中看到了什么？''完美。'",
"Abyssal Pressure": "深渊压力",
"'What do you see in the winds?' 'Memories.'": "'你在风中看到了什么？''回忆。'",
"Piece together the history of the stars and their followers. Much was lost when the Locks razed the lands in their rise to power.": "拼凑星辰及其追随者的历史。当锁之众在崛起中夷平诸地时，许多都已遗失。",
"The rites of nimble Glenmorgue. The trials of armored el-Adke. The shrines of singing Pendra.": "敏捷的格伦莫格的仪式。装甲的艾尔-阿德克的试炼。歌唱的彭德拉的神殿。",
"It's not easy to look at.": "实在不忍直视。",
"Forged in the hottest of fires, under the immense pressure, not even the most extraordinary smith could produce metal of such quality.": "在最炽热的火焰中锻造，在巨大压力之下，即使最非凡的铁匠也无法生产如此品质的金属。",
"Old Growth's Gift": "远古生长的馈赠",
