"Stop.": "停止。",
"Dissect a body for components. Only the best pieces will serve.": "解剖尸体以获取部件。只有最好的部件才能用。",
"Grind bones into dust.": "将骨头磨成粉末。",
"Grind a skull into dust.": "将头骨磨成粉末。",
