"Enchantment": "附魔",
"Imbue Gem (Earth)": "灌注宝石（大地）",
"A tramp abroad.": "浪迹天涯。",
"An incidental necessity to the advancement of magic.": "魔法进步的附带必需品。",
"Why do they come to me to die?": "为什么他们都来找我赴死？",
"Stay hidden as you make copies of the tomes in the endless depths of the infinite library.": "藏身于无尽图书馆的无尽深处，复制其中的典籍。",
"Things beyond even your comprehension lair here.": "此处潜藏着连你都无法理解之物。",
"An ordinary wizard's cap.": "一顶普通的巫师帽。",
"Dig up old graves for magical reagents. These guys are like 300 years old, they won't mind.": "挖掘古老坟墓以获取魔法试剂。这些家伙都死了300年了，不会介意的。",
"It's for a good cause.": "这是为了正义的事业。",
"Experiment on dead or soon-to-be-dead subjects. This is not something a good wizard would do.": "在已死或即将死亡的对象上进行实验。这不是一个好巫师会做的事。",
"Vile Acts": "卑劣行为",
"Capture a soul within a spirit gem.": "将灵魂捕获于灵魂宝石中。",
"Crystallize new pure embers, using your soul embers as catalysts.": "以你的灵魂余烬为催化剂，结晶出新的纯净余烬。",
"Leech blood from a body to restore your health.": "从尸体上吸取血液以恢复健康。",
"Embark on a perilous adventure to shape the world as you see fit. For good or ill.": "踏上危险的冒险，按照你的意愿塑造世界。无论善恶。",
"Grants more Tales, the more good and/or evil aligned moralities and classes you obtain.": "获得越多善良和/或邪恶阵营的道德与职业，获得更多传说。",
