"You call it an empire, but in the gloaming I see only heaps of crumbled stone.": "你称之为帝国，但在暮色中我只看到一堆堆 崩塌的石头。",
"Drain corpses of their lingering life-force to prolong your bleak existence.": "抽取尸体残留的生命力，以延长你黯淡的存在。",
