 "Must live outdoors and be capable of enchanting. ": "必须居住在户外并能够附魔。",
 "A house of gears and levers, constantly adjusting to the requirements of its occupant.": "一座齿轮与杠杆之屋，不断根据居住者的需求进行调整。",
"A peaceful structure where you can devote yourself fully to your arts.": "一个宁静的建筑，你可以在此全心投入你的技艺。",
"Deep in Delkin Wood, Master Wild kept his fabled camp.": "在德尔金森林深处，怀尔德大师保留了他传说中的营地。",
"Outdoors, Plantsource, Pets, Patron, Home": "户外，植物源，宠物，赞助人，家",
"A gathering of like-minded nature appreciators in the wilderness.": "荒野中志同道合的自然爱好者聚集地。",
"Outdoors, Starsource, Plantsource, Pets, Mobile Home, Home": "户外，星之源，植物源，宠物，移动之家，家",
"Outdoors, Pets, Starsource, Mobile Home, Home": "户外，宠物，星之源，移动之家，家",
"A once luxurious and sprawling estate, with much of the amenities ruined. Still much more comfortable than most homes.": "曾经奢华广阔的庄园，大部分设施已废墟。但仍比大多数家舒适得多。",
"A once vast and practical fortress, laid low by the ravages of time. It still has room for mercenaries.": "曾经广阔而实用的堡垒，被时间的摧残所击垮。仍有容纳佣兵的空间。",
"The sprout of an idrasil seed. It has a long way to go under your care, but even now it towers over much of the forest.": "伊德拉希尔种子发出的嫩芽。在你的照料下还有很长的路要走，但即便如此，它已经高耸于森林大部分树木之上。",
"A repository of countless disguises to further your research.": "无数伪装宝库，用于推进你的研究。",
