"Unknown Timeline": "未知时间线",
"⚔Unknown Timeline": "⚔未知时间线",
"Foredoomed": "宿命",
"Troubleshooter": "故障排除者",
"Vile Acts, Dungeon": "邪恶行为，地下城",
"The unmistakable ticking of a timepiece of your own making catches your attention. Who could possibly own one?": "一座你自己制作的时钟发出的清晰滴答声引起了你的注意。谁会拥有它呢？",
"In the innermost part of a castle you find a chamber, guarded by unusually well-armed automata. it's clear that whatever's controlling the castle is here.": "在城堡最深处，你发现了一个房间，由武装异常精良的自动机守卫着。显然，操控这座城堡的东西就在这里。",
"Go out and steal, plunder and otherwise ruin a once peaceful village.": "出去偷窃、掠夺，毁掉这个曾经宁静的村庄。",
"⚔Pillage Village Distance: {{0}} at {{1}} slowly increasing to {{2}} total at {{3}} ": "⚔劫掠村庄距离：{{0}}（{{1}}时）逐步增加至总计{{2}}（{{3}}时）",
"By utilizing waterways, one can discover hidden passages into the second city ring of Reedburgh.": "利用水道，可以发现通往里德堡第二环城的隐蔽通道。",
"When the fetid barrows were discovered, dark acolytes gathered at the mounds seeking ancient patrons of their art.": "当恶臭的古墓被发现时，黑暗侍僧聚集在土丘周围，寻求他们技艺的古老庇护者。",
"Deeper in the land of raw elements lies a huge area with much higher density of mana. Something inside it is causing this phenomenon.": "在原始元素之地的深处，有一片法力密度极高的广阔区域。其中的某种存在正在引发这一现象。",
"A large castle moving and shaping itself endlessly.": "一座不断移动和重塑自身的巨大城堡。",

"Chaos Bolt": "混沌弹",
"Costs part of your hp, scaling with the amount of blood mastery classes you took. Deals damage based on your max hp, improved with use and blood classes taken.": "消耗部分生命值，随你拥有的血魔法精通职业数量提升。基于最大生命值造成伤害，随使用次数和血系职业数量增强。",
"You would put it in a sausage instead, but you are not in the mood.": "你倒是想把它塞进香肠里，但现在没那个心情。",
"A blood-curdling sight.": "令人毛骨悚然的景象。",
"Amount of blood gems acquired is approximately 1 per 250 maximum hp an opponent had": "获得血宝石的数量约为对手每250点最大生命值1颗。",
"Coagulant Poison": "凝血毒素",
"Inject an enemy with a coagulant, allowing you to crystallize their blood.": "向敌人注射凝血剂，将他们的血液结晶化。",
"Don't lose your way.": "别迷路了。",
"Like the power of the sun": "如太阳之力",
"Cannot be performed when suffering from consuming flames ": "处于吞噬烈焰状态下无法施放",
"Explosively ignite a soul ember": "引爆一颗灵魂余烬",
"Emerge": "现身",
"Unstable Footing": "立足不稳",
"Cyril's Celestial Sling": "西里尔的天界投索",
"Loan Shark": "放贷鲨",
"Summon a loan shark to track down your debtors. Comes with a suit and country club membership.": "召唤一头放贷鲨追踪你的债务人。附带西装和乡村俱乐部会员资格。",

