"Game Mechanic, Tasks, Glossary Entry": "游戏机制，任务系统，术语说明",
"/'Dark and selfish deeds follow you, leaving a stain on your soul./'": "/'卑劣自私的行径伴随左右，令你的灵魂沾染罪孽。/'",
"➢ Evil amount is generally granted by actions tagged as either /'Evil Acts/' or /'Vile Acts/', with you being able to check your evil score in the Player Tab.": "➢ 邪恶通常由标记为 /'恶行/' 或 /'卑劣行径/'的行动积累获得, 你可以在玩家面板中查看自身的邪恶数值.",
"Some of the best ways to earn evil in the early game is through Arcane Thievery, unlocked via the Trickery skill, and Murder, unlocked via the Anatomy and Umbramancy skills.": "在游戏前期, 高效获取邪恶值的方法包括偷窃(通过诡计技能解锁)以及谋杀(通过解剖学与暗影魔法解锁).",
"➢ Sufficient amounts of evil will either automatically grant or unlock the ability to select evil moralities which boost your shadow magic at the expense of light magic.": "➢ 当邪恶积累到足够数量时, 将自动解锁邪恶道德倾向(或允许你主动选择该倾向); 它会强化你的暗影魔法, 但同时会削弱光明魔法.",
"These evil moralities are necessary for unlocking many of the evil classes.": "邪恶道德倾向是解锁众多邪恶职业的必要前置条件.",
"➢ With high enough evil, you will be prevented from performing /'Good Acts/' and /'Virtuous Acts/' altogether and unable to cast the stronger light healing spells.": "➢ 如果邪恶值过高,你将无法执行 /'善举/' 和 /'义举/', 也无法施展高阶光明治愈系魔法.",
"Such restrictions generally begin from the /'Sinister/' level of evil morality.": "这类限制通常在道德等级到达 /'险恶/' 时开始生效.",
"➢ The progression of evil moralities are as follows:": "➢ 道德的邪恶等级递进如下:",
"• Immoral - Automatically granted - Have an evil score of 5.": "• 伤风败俗 - 自动获得 - 邪恶值达到 5.",
"• Wicked - Automatically granted - Have an evil score of 250.": "• 歹毒 - 自动获得 - 邪恶值达到 250.",
"• Vile - Automatically granted - Have an evil score of 500 or Graduate via Slaying your Master. Requires Tier 0.": "• 卑劣 - 自动获得 - 邪恶值达到 500 或通过弑师晋升. 需要 阶级 0.",
"• Sinister - Have an evil score of 1000. Requires Tier 1.": "• 险恶 - 邪恶值达到 1000. 需要 阶级 1.",
"• Irredeemable - Have an evil score of 2000. Requires Tier 3.": "• 无可救药 - 邪恶值达到 2000. 需要 阶级 3.",
"• Malevolence - Requires Tier 4. Never earned the /'Respectable/' morality trait. (Check the /'Virtue/' glossary to see how to avoid it.)": "• 暴虐 - 需要 阶级 4. 且从未获得 /'善良/' 道德特质. (可查看 /'善良/' 词条了解规避方法.)",
"➢ It is possible to back out of evil and become virtuous as long as you are not Irredeemable.": "➢ 只要尚未到达 无可救药 的邪恶等级, 就还能弃恶从善, 回归善良.",
