 "Quest Unlocked: {{0}}": "任务已解锁：{{0}}",
 "After taking your savings, your new master grants you a small nook under the stairs.": "收走你的积蓄后，新导师给了你楼梯下的一个小角落。",
"After your daily castigation, your master mentions the rats in the basement have become a problem. Something about stolen shortswords and building barricades. You had better go down and deal with it.": "每日训诫后，导师提到地下室的鼠患成了问题。什么偷短剑、搭路障之类的。你最好下去处理一下。",
"In return for your new services, your master grants you a small allowance for your studies. The position does require of course, some initial fees...": "作为新职责的回报，导师给了你一小笔学习津贴。当然，这个职位需要先交一些费用……",
"Under your master's critical eye, you compile your very own book of spells.": "在导师挑剔的目光下，你编撰了自己的法术书。",
"The first day of Spring brings Beltane, when the old pacts loosen and the kell walk freely among mortals. The great fires are kindled, maypoles are raised, and fertility and fire magic surge through the land.": "春天的第一天带来了贝尔坦节，古老契约松动，凯尔精灵在凡人中自由行走。篝火点燃，五月柱竖起，丰饶与火焰魔法在大地中涌动。",
"Lend gold to needy and foolish": "借钱给贫困和愚蠢的人",
"Oversee the funerary rites of merchants and nobles.": "监督商人和贵族的葬礼仪式。",
"Manual labor to pay off your debt, a horrific thought for any self-respecting wizard": "靠体力劳动还债，对于任何有自尊的法师来说都是可怕的想法。",
"No magic allowed, since the chronomancy incident.": "由于时间魔法事故，禁止使用魔法。",
"Lend some of your machinae to perform menial tasks": "借出一些机械体执行杂务。",
"Delve the depths for gems of mystic potential. Requires a mine or sufficient geosculpting.": "深入地下寻找具有神秘潜力的宝石。需要矿井或足够的大地塑形能力。",
"Put on a show with animated puppets": "用活化傀儡表演一场戏。",
